right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265732 "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-6{x}_{3} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265752 "Solve the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=-3 \\\\ -{x}_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265753 "Solve the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=-1 \\\\ -{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=7 \\\\ 2{x}_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265765 "![](images/b9/b946843e712c6294e261cb3015b02bc065cd265763805cf046009a2db0d11b83.png)\n\nConsider the region $D$ shown above. If \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}{e}^{x+y}, & (x,y)\\in R\\cap D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in R∖D\\end{aligned}\\,\\text{and}\\,{∬}_{D}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhich of the following could be the definition of the rectangular domain $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply."] [#edb/ref 17592186265767 "Let $D$ be a finite region enclosed by the curve $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{9}+{y}^{2}=1.$ If \n\n$$\nf(x,y)={\\begin{aligned}9-{x}^{2}, & (x,y)\\in R\\cap D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in R∖D\\end{aligned}\\,\\text{and}\\,{∬}_{D}(9-{x}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhich of the following could be the definition of the rectangular domain $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply."] [#edb/ref 17592186265769 "Let $D$ be a finite region enclosed by the curve $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}=1.$ If \n\n$$\nf(x,y)={\\begin{aligned}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y, & (x,y)\\in R\\cap D \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in R∖D\\end{aligned}\\,\\text{and}\\,{∬}_{D}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,\\text{d}A={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhich of the following could be the definition of the rectangular domain $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply."] [#edb/ref 17592186265774 "![](images/77/779f39d9b8eca56cf8b7b2b9355364cd95171ca61c3e