 the matrix $C,$ given by\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the following row operations on $C?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}-2{R}_{2} \\\\ {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265810 "Consider the matrix $C,$ given by\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the following row operations on $C?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+3{R}_{3} \\\\ {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+5{R}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265812 "Consider the augmented matrix $V,$ given by\n\n$$\nV=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 9 & -2 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 4 & 6 & 7 \\\\ 9 & 0 & 5 & 7\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the following row operations on $V?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\ {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1)\\cdot {R}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265821 "$|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 & 1 & 5 \\\\ -7 & 2 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3 & -1\\end{aligned}|=$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265922 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+y &=4 \\\\ x-y &=-10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265923 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-1 &=4y \\\\ y &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265924 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-5 &=y \\\\ y &=2x+3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265925 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3 &=y \\\\ 1 &=-2+x\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265929 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y+z &=1 \\\\ -x-3y+9z &=-2 \\\\ 4x-7y-z &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & c \\\\ -1 & b & 9 \\\\ a & -7 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265930 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3x+y+7z &=5 \\\\ x-4y+8z &=1 \\\\ -6y+9z &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -4 & b \\\\ 0 & a & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}c \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b,$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265931 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}z-7x-5 &=0 \\\\ 4y-x-3z-2 &=0 \\\\ 2y+x-8 &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & a \\\\ b & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ c\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b,$ and $c?$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265950 "$|\\begin{aligned}160 & 184 & 76 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 160 & 184 & 78\\end{aligned}|=$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265974 "Given that \n$|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ a & b+2\\end{aligned}|=8$,\nfind \n$|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ a+3 & b\\end{aligned}|.$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265980 "Find the product ${E}_{1}{E}_{2}^{-1}$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{E}_{1} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{E}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186265982 "Find the product ${E}_{1}{E}_{2}^{-1}$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{E}_{1} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{E}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [#edb/ref 17592186266012 "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=-1 \\\\ -4x+8y &=7.\\end{aligned}\\r